sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Dev as Developer / Agent
  participant GH as GitHub (Repo & App)
  participant CF as Cloudflare Worker (j26-review-bot)
  participant DO as Durable Object (Review / SQLite)
  participant Modal as Modal Scanner (FastAPI)
  participant Rubric as Cursor Rubric (SKILL.md)
  participant Agent as Claude Sonnet 3.5/5.5 (QuickJS)
  participant MCP as Streamable HTTP MCP (Context.dev / MS Learn)
  participant UI as Web Dashboard (/r/... & /m/...)

  Dev->>GH: Open / Synchronize Pull Request
  GH->>CF: POST /webhook (pull_request event)
  CF->>DO: Route event by PR & head commit SHA
  DO->>DO: Initialize SQLite state & set alarm heartbeat
  DO->>GH: Post initial sticky comment with review link

  rect rgb(240, 245, 255)
    note over DO,Modal: Step 1: Deterministic Static Scans
    DO->>Modal: POST /scan (commit SHA, scanner tools, token)
    Modal->>Modal: Download tarball & execute zizmor, ty, oxlint
    Modal-->>DO: Return normalized diagnostics JSON
    DO->>DO: Store diagnostics in SQLite
  end

  rect rgb(255, 245, 240)
    note over DO,Rubric: Step 2: Fetch Pinned Review Rubric
    DO->>Rubric: GET Cursor thermo-nuclear SKILL.md
    Rubric-->>DO: Return rubric text
    DO->>DO: Compute & verify SHA256 of rubric
  end

  rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
    note over DO,MCP: Step 3: AI Code Review & Docs Gate
    DO->>Agent: Start agent turns with rubric, diff, & diagnostics
    loop Code Mode Exploration
      Agent->>GH: Read PR overview, patch, & files
      Agent->>MCP: Query Context.dev (web) / MS Learn (docs)
      MCP-->>Agent: Return official docs / search results
      Agent->>DO: Record consulted documentation
    end
    Agent->>DO: Confirm findings or dismiss scanner diagnostics
    DO->>DO: Enforce Docs Gate (refuse finish if no docs checked)
    Agent->>DO: finish_review(summary, dismissed, not_checked)
  end

  rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
    note over DO,GH: Step 4: Decision & Status Update
    DO->>DO: Derive advisory decision from findings
    alt No critical/high verified/likely findings
      DO->>GH: Submit PR Approval (commit head)
    else Blocker findings detected
      DO->>GH: Request changes / report blockers
    end
    DO->>GH: Update sticky PR comment with summary & chips
  end

  loop Live Polling
    UI->>DO: GET /api/r/:owner/:repo/:pr/:sha (every 2s)
    DO-->>UI: Return live turns, diagnostics, & findings
  end
